OL,5,G0350 The Brigitte Bardot Story
OL,6,     FFrench actress and singer Brigitte
OL,7,     FBardot rose to fame with films
OL,8,     Fthat challenged conservative
OL,9,     Fnorms. This documentary tells the
OL,10,     Fstory of her becoming an
OL,11,     Finternational icon and sex symbol.
OL,12,G0430 Calling All Cars
OL,13,     F1954. Starring Cardew Robinson,
OL,14,     FAdrienne Fancey, John Fitzgerald
OL,15,     Fand Pauline Olsen. Comedy
OL,16,     Fdocumentary, centring on the Dover
OL,17,     FHarbour car terminal. Directed by
OL,18,     FMaclean Rogers.
